# Rover operator flowcharts

When you change **operator instructions** in any of these:

- `docs/OPERATOR-ONE-TIME-SETUP.md`
- `docs/OPERATOR-SITE-RUNBOOK.md`
- Lead-mail / forms / Launch steps in `docs/ENV-SETUP.md`, `docs/LAUNCH.md`, or `docs/ASSEMBLE-AND-LAUNCH.md`

Also update the visual maps in the **same change**:

1. Follow the checklist in **`docs/OPERATOR-FLOWS.md`** (Maintenance checklist).
2. Edit the matching Mermaid source under `docs/flows/` (`one-time-setup.mmd` and/or `running-the-app.mmd`).
3. Regenerate assets: `.\scripts\render-operator-flows.ps1`
4. Keep `docs/flows/operator-flows.html` labels aligned with the `.mmd` files.
5. Do not leave the manuals and flowcharts disagreeing on steps, order, or “no Web3Forms”.
